title open problem 5, settled: one move per name

# Section 15, open problem 5 -- settled 2026-08-30.  Both sides rename
# the same file, differently.  Earlier drafts merged the two renames
# into one pool carrying both new names, link count 2, on the argument
# that a hardlink filesystem can express the union of both intents and
# the union loses nothing.  The project rejected the union as policy:
# each renamer asked for one file with one name, and the union hands
# both of them a link count neither asked for.  The rule that replaced
# it is the one-move rule of Definition 9.3: a name may be moved at
# most once, and a name moved by both sides is a name conflict unless
# the two sides left the pool with identical name sets.
#
# The two folders sit on the two sides of that line.
#
# linked/ is where nothing changed.  The file already had two names;
#   each side renamed a DIFFERENT one of them.  Every name was moved
#   exactly once, both renames are honored, and the file comes out
#   carrying its two new names.
#
# single/ is where the settlement bites.  notes.txt had exactly one
#   name.  One person renamed it to journal.txt, the other to
#   diary.txt: the same name, moved twice, to different places.  That
#   is a name conflict -- the certificate names notes.txt and both
#   destinations -- and the component is quarantined, so the output
#   keeps onto's arrangement until a human picks the name.

tree base
  1-1: /
    2-100: single/
      10-100: notes.txt = notes-v1
    3-100: linked/
      20-100: photo.jpg = photo-v1
      20-100: photo-copy.jpg

tree onto
  1-1: /
    2-100: single/
      10-100: journal.txt = notes-v1
    3-100: linked/
      20-100: album.jpg = photo-v1
      20-100: photo-copy.jpg

tree offof
  1-1: /
    2-100: single/
      10-100: diary.txt = notes-v1
    3-100: linked/
      20-100: photo.jpg = photo-v1
      20-100: album-copy.jpg

# --- expected result, generated by gen-expected.js ---
expect conflict name
expect quarantined /single/journal.txt

tree expected
  1-1: /
    3-100: linked
      20-100: album-copy.jpg = photo-v1
      20-100: album.jpg
    2-100: single
      10-100: journal.txt = notes-v1
